# Text files are LF everywhere, in the repository and in every working copy,
# whatever `core.autocrlf` says (Git for Windows sets it to true). Prettier and
# .editorconfig write LF too, so a checkout and a save never disagree.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary: never converted, never diffed as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
